/span><span begin="02:29.370" end="02:30.510">I </span><span begin="02:30.510" end="02:31.080">never </span><span begin="02:31.080" end="02:31.710">wanna </span><span begin="02:31.710" end="02:32.280">say </span><span begin="02:32.280" end="02:34.140">goodbye</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.320" end="02:40.710"><span begin="02:34.320" end="02:34.770">But </span><span begin="02:34.770" end="02:35.340">girl </span><span begin="02:35.340" end="02:35.730">you </span><span begin="02:35.730" end="02:36.360">make </span><span begin="02:36.360" end="02:36.660">it </span><span begin="02:36.660" end="02:37.140">hard </span><span begin="02:37.140" end="02:37.590">to </span><span begin="02:37.590" end="02:37.980">be </span><span begin="02:37.980" end="02:40.710">faithful</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:41.550" end="02:46.110"><span begin="02:41.550" end="02:42.060">With </span><span begin="02:42.060" end="02:42.240">the </span><span begin="02:42.240" end="02:43.050">lips </span><span begin="02:43.050" end="02:43.740">of </span><span begin="02:43.740" end="02:44.190">an </span><span begin="02:44.190" end="02:46.110">angel</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:12.750" end="03:17.250"><span begin="03:12.750" end="03:13.020">It's </span><span begin="03:13.020" end="03:13.380">really </span><span begin="03:13.380" end="03:13.650">good </span><span begin="03:13.650" end="03:13.830">to </span><span begin="03:13.830" end="03:14.310">hear </span><span begin="03:14.310" end="03:14.730">your </span><span begin="03:14.730" end="03:15.630">voice </span><span begin="03:15.630" end="03:16.200">saying </span><span begin="03:16.200" end="03:16.620">my </span><span begin="03:16.620" end="03:17.250">name</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:17.250" end="03:19.980"><span begin="03:17.250" end="03:17.460">It </span><span begin="03:17.460" end="03:18.180">sounds </span><span begin="03:18.180" end="03:18.720">so </span><span begin="03:18.720" end="03:19.980">sweet</span></p><p ttm:age